  "description": "A modern home bar area with a sleek and minimalist design. The bar counter is made of white marble with subtle veining, illuminated by soft underlighting. Three yellow bar stools with chrome legs add a pop of color and contrast against the neutral tones. Behind the bar, open shelves are stocked with an assortment of liquor bottles, backlit for a warm ambiance. Potted plants on the counter and shelves bring a touch of greenery to the space. Floor-to-ceiling glass windows in the background provide a view of lush outdoor greenery, enhancing the open and airy feel of the room.",
